SUMMARY:Arts / Parade Committee Meeting - Open To All Adults
DESCRIPTION:Date: June 17th from 7PM to 9PM\nLocation: Lotus Firebay\n🤠 Calling All Arts Cowboys\, Makers\, Dreamers & Community Builders 🎨✨\nHelp spear the vibe of Lotus Festival 2026.\nThe Lotus Arts Committee is officially opening its doors for a new season of collaboration\, creativity\, and community-powered artmaking\, and ALL are welcome. Whether you’re an artist\, builder\, painter\, musician\, costume maker\, volunteer\, storyteller\, lantern carrier\, or just someone who wants to make something beautiful with other people… there’s a place for you here. \nThis year we’ll gather for:\n✨ Open conversations about arts in the community\n✨ Planning and building the Lotus Fest Parade\n✨ Arts Village activations and interactive experiences\n✨ Weekly collaborative art projects we create together \nThe major collaborative project led by KP this season will be the Lanterns of Luminaria\, helping light the path of Lotus Fest weekend with community-made lanterns\, movement\, and glowing art. We’ll also host a community Flag Project with guest leaders and additional collaborative builds throughout the season. \nNo pressure. No experience required. Come weekly\, check in monthly\, or volunteer once. Truly all hands on deck are welcome and needed. \nLighting of the Lanterns of Luminaria\nFriday\, October 2nd\, 2026 — 6:00 PM \nLotus Fest Parade\nSaturday\, October 3rd\, 2026 — 8:30 PM \nCome make art. Make friends. Make something unforgettable together.
URL:https://www.lotusfest.org/event/arts-parade-committee-meeting-open-to-all-adults-2/
LOCATION:Lotus Firebay\, 105 S Rogers Street\, Bloomington\, IN\, 47404\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts Activity,Exhibits & Installations,Firebay Rental
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://www.lotusfest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Site-Event-Images-3.webp
