SUMMARY:Venue Committee - Open Call Out
DESCRIPTION:Dates: June 22nd ; July 6 ; July 20\nTime: 5:30 PM – 6:30 PM\nHelp create the spaces where the magic happens. \nThe Lotus Festival doesn’t just appear overnight. It is imagined\, designed\, built\, and brought to life by a community of volunteers. The Venue Committee helps transform festival spaces into welcoming places for connection\, creativity\, and cultural celebration. \nAs a member of the Venue Committee\, you can expect to: \n✨ Help design and create festival signage\n✨ Assist with decorating and beautifying festival spaces\n✨ Support venue setup before the festival\n✨ Help with teardown after the festival\n✨ Collaborate with a team of creative and community-minded volunteers\n✨ Attend committee meetings and contribute ideas throughout the summer \nNo special experience is required\, just a willingness to pitch in\, work as part of a team\, and help create an incredible festival experience for thousands of attendees. \nThis committee is hands-on. Some volunteers enjoy the creative design side\, while others enjoy building\, organizing\, moving materials\, and making sure everything comes together smoothly. Every role matters. \nFirst Meeting: June 22\nEvery Other Monday | 5:30 PM – 6:30 PM\nLotus Education & Arts Foundation \nIf you’ve ever looked around the festival and thought\, “How did all of this come together?”…this is your chance to be part of the answer. \n  \nCome help us build the world of Lotus.
URL:https://www.lotusfest.org/event/venue-committee-open-call-out/
LOCATION:Lotus Education and Arts Foundation\, 105 S Rogers St\, Bloomington\, IN 47404\, Bloomington\, IN\, 47404\, US
CATEGORIES:Free Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://www.lotusfest.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Site-Event-Images-4.webp
